<title>PORTUGAL: Outlook for Portuguese trade positive - INE.</title>
<headline>Outlook for Portuguese trade positive - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outlook for Portuguese trade in the coming months is positive, the National Statistics Institute (INE) said.</p>
<p>Its indicator for trade activity in December was positive in line with the second half of 1996 and showed encouraging results in the retail sector, INE said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +(351-1) 3538254</p>
</text>
